    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Guard decisions, by label",
      "description": "How the Guard judged each request, per 15 minutes: work (a normal engineering task), out_of_scope (not engineering work), risky (it asks to change or delete something), malicious (it looks like an attack or abuse). In monitor mode the Guard only records this and blocks nothing: the bars show what enforce mode would do. From the span wattson.guard.request.",
      "datasource": {
